<http://www.loa-cnr.it/ontologies/DOLCE-Lite#event> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                                                    rdfs:comment "Un evento es un suceso importante y programado, de índole social, académica, artística o deportiva."@es;
                                                    rdfs:label "Evento"@es;
                                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <http://www.loa-cnr.it/ontologies/Collectives#social-type-collective>,
