<http://www.loa-cnr.it/ontologies/DOLCE-Lite#part> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                                                   rdfs:domain <http://www.loa-cnr.it/ontologies/DOLCE-Lite#temporal-region>;
